# 11.34 fire20b (user 2026-10-16 "정점부터 호에 붉은 기 스밈 (Recommended)", D308-90 TEST):
# the swung arc stays ink while the brush swings; from the apex 노's pigment soaks into it from the tip back toward the
# tail (SwingInk308Profile.Soaks, written by swingink) and the arc dries slower after the apex (aging x .55).
# One cast at timeScale .25, recorded by rec:fire20b; brushlog prints BRUSH lines and INK on/off lines against LAUNCHED.
call SpellLab308 Run build
sleep 3
call Oheangbu.EditorTools.SpellVFX120.Vfx308Build Run build
sleep 3
call Oheangbu.EditorTools.SpellVFX120.Vfx308Build Run swingink
sleep 3
call SpellLab308 Run play
wait lab
sleep 3
?call SwingProbe308 Run reset
?call SwingProbe308 Run on
?call SwingProbe308 Run target:6
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:0.25
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:fire20b:34
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run brushlog:6
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 6
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 8
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 14
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:stop
?call SpellLab308 Run top:lab_fire20b_end
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire20b_end
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:1
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run brush
?call SwingProbe308 Run report
mem
finally:
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:stop
?call SpellLab308 Run stop
sleep 6
